{"schema":"LAW_EN_DOCUMENT_V1","id":"i18n-4704f8c71f66be226a1088439bc26f3712c596ebd2792127","family_id":"KR:012159","country":"KR","language":"en","title":"Special Act on Investigating the Truth of the April 16 Sewol Ferry Disaster and Building a Safe Society","title_original":"4ㆍ16세월호참사 진상규명 및 안전사회 건설 등을 위한 특별법","kind":"법률","source_version":"284117","promulgated":null,"effective":null,"translation_status":"AI_DRAFT","body_status":"BODY_LOADED","source_url":"https://www.law.go.kr/LSW/lsInfoP.do?lsiSeq=284117","source_sha256":"c141291f23520264444e31f7c7002ae169ff7b5f49b50f81aade863d8c364da6","body_sha256":"88729fdc1f9232e891d94ff95a7373dfdd2e5858aa8a3525f77f31f7ddd1d4bd","article_count":1,"full_text":"Article 1 (Purpose)\nThe purpose of this Act is, in relation to the disaster that followed the sinking of the Sewol Ferry on April 16, 2014, in waters near Jodo-myeon, Jindo-gun, Jeonnam-Gwangju Integrated Special City, to ascertain the truth concerning the causes of the disaster, the procedures followed to manage the disaster, follow-up measures, etc.; to identify the locus of responsibility; to provide support to sufferers; and to build and establish a safe society by formulating measures for preventing and responding to further accidents and disasters.\n<Amended on Mar. 5, 2026>\n","metadata":{"author_method":"Exact held-source units translated or completed using explicitly recorded source/target spans; original official records remain unchanged. All new units are MACHINE_TRANSLATION and UNREVIEWED.","author_title_record":{"path":"D:\\lawsofkorea\\projece\\07_법률번역\\06_법령별다국어완성\\LAW12_20261018_1442\\workc_1129_2094\\review_pending\\WORKC_G01_P04\\1525_KR012159\\translations\\act\\en.title.json","sha256":"4c74ab84248a6134281cf6996ae8261b572ae5b9e5754e6ad1e8c39880d0d84f"},"author_unit_artifacts":[{"json":{"path":"D:\\lawsofkorea\\projece\\07_법률번역\\06_법령별다국어완성\\LAW12_20261018_1442\\workc_1129_2094\\review_pending\\WORKC_G01_P04\\1525_KR012159\\translations\\act\\en.units